---
/**
 * Lamplight's terms and conditions (the Android game). Linked from Google Play and from the game's Settings.
 * Facts come from the build: free to play, coins are the only currency and are earned only, no real-money
 * purchases, optional rewarded videos with daily limits, progress saved only on the device.
 */
import LegalLayout from '../../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../../lib/site';

const toc = [
  { id: 'game', label: 'The game' },
  { id: 'items', label: 'Coins, hearts and hints' },
  { id: 'videos', label: 'Optional videos' },
  { id: 'progress', label: 'Your progress' },
  { id: 'fair', label: 'Fair play' },
  { id: 'ours', label: 'What is ours' },
  { id: 'warranty', label: 'No guarantee' },
  { id: 'changes', label: 'Changes' },
  { id: 'contact', label: 'Contact' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Lamplight terms and conditions"
  description="The rules for playing Lamplight, the free puzzle game for Android by IsmailApps: earned coins only, optional videos, progress saved on your phone."
  updated="21 November 2026"
  toc={toc}
  crumbs={[
    { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
    { href: '/games', label: 'Games' },
    { href: '/games/lamplight', label: 'Lamplight' },
    { label: 'Terms and conditions' },
  ]}
>
  <p>
    These terms apply when you download or play <strong>Lamplight</strong>, our puzzle game for Android. By playing, you
    agree to them. If you are under 18, please read them with a parent or guardian. How the game handles data is explained
    in the <a href="/games/lamplight/privacy-policy">Lamplight privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="game">The game</h2>
  <p>
    Lamplight is free to download and play. It is made by IsmailApps ({site.founder.legalName}). You may play it for your
    own personal, non-commercial enjoyment. Google Play's own terms also apply to downloading it.
  </p>

  <h2 id="items">Coins, hearts and hints</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Coins, hearts, hints, stars and streak days are parts of the game. They have <strong>no real-money value</strong>, are
      not your property, and cannot be exchanged for money or anything outside the game.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Nothing in the game is sold for real money.</strong> Coins are only earned by playing or by optional videos.</li>
    <li>We may change how many coins things earn or cost, and how hearts refill, to keep the game fair and fun.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="videos">Optional videos</h2>
  <p>
    Some rewards come from short video ads that you choose to watch. A reward is given only when Google's ad service
    confirms the video was watched. Closing it early gives nothing. Videos are not always available, and each reward has a
    daily limit. Ads are shown by Google AdMob, and we don't control which advertiser appears, though we only allow ads
    rated for general audiences.
  </p>

  <h2 id="progress">Your progress</h2>
  <p>
    Your progress is saved only on your phone. If you uninstall the game, clear its data or change phones, it is gone, and
    we cannot restore it, because we never had a copy.
  </p>

  <h2 id="fair">Fair play</h2>
  <p>
    Please don't modify the game, its files or its save data, or change your phone's clock, to get extra rewards. We may
    correct rewards that come from doing so in a later update.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ours">What is ours</h2>
  <p>
    The game, its puzzles, story, characters, pictures, music and sounds belong to IsmailApps or are used under licence.
    You may share screenshots and videos of your own play. Please don't copy, resell or redistribute the game itself.
  </p>

  <h2 id="warranty">No guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to make Lamplight fun and free of bugs, but the game is provided "as is", without a promise that it will
    always work, be available, or suit every device. As far as the law allows, we are not liable for any loss caused by
    using the game, including lost progress. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under consumer law that cannot
    be limited.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update the game and these terms. When the terms change, we update the date at the top of this page. If you keep
    playing after that, the new terms apply.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions, problems or ideas: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
